message: "If you use or discuss this software or evidence, cite the exact release tag or commit."
title: "Quantum-Classical Recognition Validation: Multi-Ledger Operator-Memory Benchmark"
type: software
version: "0.1.0-rc1"
authors:
  - family-names: "Dabas"
    given-names: "Parveen"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-6948-209X"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
abstract: >-
  A bounded public research package for testing a quantum representation of
  decomposable operator-order memory using separate ledgers, selective erasure,
  declared readout projection, reduced-model comparisons, hardware observations,
  cross-run evaluation, manifests, and machine-readable certificates. The
  package does not claim physical device validation, a material memory mechanism,
  quantum advantage, thermodynamic proof, or a new universal law.
keywords:
  - quantum-classical validation
  - operator order
  - quantum memory representation
  - selective erasure
  - IBM Quantum
  - reproducible research
  - research certificates
  - evidence manifests
repository-code: "https://github.com/Parveen117/Quantum-Classical-public"
